23:52.790 --> 23:53.590
Cis.

23:54.000 --> 23:55.960
Bermimpilah dia.

23:56.100 --> 23:58.250
[Rancangan Si Malas melarikan diri]

23:57.590 --> 23:58.440
Cik.

23:58.250 --> 23:59.510
