25:36.820 --> 25:38.230
Saya... saya terima.

25:48.110 --> 25:48.920
Tunggu.

25:51.070 --> 25:51.880
Ayah?

25:53.510 --> 25:54.540
Sayang.

25:56.830 --> 25:57.590
Tak boleh.

25:59.510 --> 26:00.590
